Included modules:
- epub.js
- epubcfi.js
- fixed-layout.js
- overlayer.js
- paginator.js
- progress.js
- search.js
- text-walker.js
- view.js

Local adjustments remain source-level and reviewable:

- renderer iframe sandboxes omit allow-scripts;
- epubcfi.js exports same-document range construction from two endpoints;
- paginators release navigation locks, avoid absent boundary sections, and
  let line-scale callers opt out of screen animation;
- external-link events include the resolved absolute href for trusted host
  policy without changing Foliate's default fallback;
- view.js exposes one current search result through its SVG overlayer; and
- search.js follows the local width style and corrects upstream cross-node and
  terminal-boundary index arithmetic.
